mapping "V7574.1" source="V7574" target="242090001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V7574 is a Swedish ICD-10 SE extension of parent V75.7 (bus occupant injured in collision
        with railway train, person on outside of vehicle, traffic accident) that adds an activity
        qualifier (SNOMED CT 242090001). Target SNOMED CT 4054296 =. The activity qualifier has no SNOMED CT
        representation; the target captures the vehicle-vs-rail collision event via the parent V75.7
        Athena crosswalk. broader: target subsumes the source (source is a more specific instance with
        activity context the target lacks). Moderate tier : mechanical crosswalk via parent V75.7 code,
        SE extension not independently re-verified in SNOMED CT browser.
        """
}
